{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23383","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和寄问刘白 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和寄问刘白","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正与刘梦得，醉笑大开口。\n适值此诗来，欢喜君知否。\n遂令高卷幕，兼遣重添酒。\n起望会稽云，东南一回首。\n爱君金玉句，举世谁人有。\n功用随日新，资材本天授。\n吟哦不能散，自午将及酉。\n遂留梦得眠，匡牀宿东牖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}